## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to stitch services: language detection, API routing, per-language OpenAI deployments, and privacy with session retention.

## Key Concepts
- Language detection and multilingual routing
- API Management as gatekeeper and routing layer
- Language-specific OpenAI deployments and fallback
- Cosmos DB TTL for per-user context and PII handling

## Code Example
```javascript
// sample language detection using Azure Text Analytics
async function detectLanguage(text) {
  const client = new TextAnalyticsClient(endpoint, credential);
  const [result] = await client.detectLanguage([text]);
  return result.primaryLanguage.iso6391Name;
}

// prompt template with language context
const promptTemplate = (language, userMessage, context) => {
  return `You are a multilingual support assistant responding in ${language}. ` +
         `Previous context: ${context}\nUser: ${userMessage}\nAssistant:`;
};
```

